# Canonicalize author identities in `git log` / `git shortlog`.
#
# Commits made from the cloud/web Claude Code environment default to the bot
# identity `Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>`. Map those back to the maintainer.
#
# NOTE: .mailmap only rewrites how names appear in git history views. Netlify
# counts Git contributors from the RAW commit author/committer, so it does NOT
# fix the "unrecognized Git contributor" deploy error on its own — you must also
# author commits as e.rebrov@takeprofit.com. See CONTRIBUTING.md.
erebrov-takeprofit <e.rebrov@takeprofit.com> <noreply@anthropic.com>
